esparagus
=========

This program is a Rust port of the protocol, sync, reset and chip-detection
logic from esptool (https://github.com/espressif/esptool), with new code
providing structured observability (NDJSON event stream, file logging, final
report, diagnostic hint engine) intended for CI/CD pipelines and LLM-driven
feedback loops.

Because esparagus contains a derived translation of esptool's protocol
implementation, the whole work is distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later to match
upstream esptool.

